  29+ 6AB1 C3 D2 6A         JP AY_PlaySFX
  30+ 6AB4
  31+ 6AB4              AY_PlayLastingPickup:
  32+ 6AB4 3E 03            LD A, AYSFX_LASTING_PICKUP
  33+ 6AB6 C3 D2 6A         JP AY_PlaySFX
  34+ 6AB9
  35+ 6AB9              AY_PlayVictoryFanfare:
