 346+ 7069              ; ==============================================================================
 347+ 7069              ; ComputeMagicCompassPath - BFS reverse con state (sid, comp_local)
 348+ 7069              ; ==============================================================================
 349+ 7069              ; Algoritmo:
 350+ 7069              ;   1. queue.push((target_sid, target_comp=0)). Mark visited.
 351+ 7069              ;      target_comp = 0 (heurística: el pickup vive en la comp principal).
 352+ 7069              ;   2. While queue not empty:
 353+ 7069              ;        (R, R_comp) = queue.pop()
 354+ 7069              ;        For each gap in RoomCompGaps[R]:
 355+ 7069              ;          If gap.comp != R_comp: skip.
 356+ 7069              ;          V = neighbor of R via gap.side.
 357+ 7069              ;          Find V's gap with side=opposite(gap.side) AND coord=gap.coord.
 358+ 7069              ;          V_comp = that gap's comp.
 359+ 7069              ;          If (V, V_comp) visited: skip.
 360+ 7069              ;          If V == current_sid AND V_comp == player_current_comp:
 361+ 7069              ;            dir_player = opposite(gap.side); STORE; RETURN.
 362+ 7069              ;          Mark visited; queue.push((V, V_comp)).
 363+ 7069              ;
 364+ 7069              ; player_current_comp se determina via LastEntrySide:
 365+ 7069              ;   - LastEntrySide = side por el que el player entró a current_sid.
 366+ 7069              ;   - player_comp = comp del gap de current_sid en LastEntrySide.
 367+ 7069              ;   - Si LastEntrySide = $FF (boot/respawn), comp = 0 (fallback).
 368+ 7069              ;
 369+ 7069              ; OUT: MagicCompassPathDir = 0=N, 1=E, 2=S, 3=W; o $FF si sin path.
 370+ 7069              ; ==============================================================================
 371+ 7069              ; ComputeMagicCompassPath — wrapper que pagina bank 7 alrededor del BFS.
 372+ 7069              ;
 373+ 7069              ; Tanto las tablas RoomCompGaps_XX como ahora el body _ComputeMagicCompassPath_Inner
 374+ 7069              ; (+ sus helpers .cmcp* / .cfmg* / .fgbs* y locales DEFB) viven en bank 7
 375+ 7069              ; (magic_compass_bfs_bank7.asm). Se movieron alli en mayo 2026 cuando los
 376+ 7069              ; thunks de bank_cutscene_thunks.asm anadieron ~135 B a slot 1 y empujaron el
 377+ 7069              ; BFS sobre $7A00 (la tabla IM2 sobreescribia el codigo BFS con $7B -> BFS
 378+ 7069              ; retornaba basura -> magic compass siempre PathDir=$FF). Mover ~690 B a
 379+ 7069              ; bank 7 dejo margen amplio en slot 1.
 380+ 7069              ;
 381+ 7069              ; Stack consistency: el caller (UpdateMagicCompass en slot 1) ENTRA con bank 0
 382+ 7069              ; paginated. El wrapper pagina bank 7, CALL _Inner (PUSH PC en bank 7 stack).
 383+ 7069              ; _Inner ejecuta todo (CALL/RET/PUSH/POP) con bank 7 stack consistente.
 384+ 7069              ; Tras RET, el wrapper pagina bank 0 antes de su propio RET, asi que el caller
 385+ 7069              ; recupera su return PC del bank 0 stack (donde fue pushed originalmente).
 386+ 7069              ;
 387+ 7069              ; Mantiene DI durante todo el chunk BFS (~4000 T = 1/15 frame). Riesgo de
 388+ 7069              ; perder ~3 IRQ por segundo de compass activo, aceptable.
 389+ 7069              ; ==============================================================================
 390+ 7069              ComputeMagicCompassPath:
 391+ 7069 F3               DI
 392+ 706A                  ; --- Page bank 7 in slot 3 ---
 393+ 706A 3A 8A 8D         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
 394+ 706D E6 F8            AND $F8
 395+ 706F F6 07            OR 7
 396+ 7071 32 8A 8D         LD (CurrentPaging), A
 397+ 7074 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
 398+ 7077 ED 79            OUT (C), A
 399+ 7079
 400+ 7079 CD 82 E3         CALL _ComputeMagicCompassPath_Inner
 401+ 707C
 402+ 707C                  ; --- Page bank 0 back ---
 403+ 707C 3A 8A 8D         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
 404+ 707F E6 F8            AND $F8
 405+ 7081 32 8A 8D         LD (CurrentPaging), A
 406+ 7084 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
 407+ 7087 ED 79            OUT (C), A
 408+ 7089
 409+ 7089 3A A2 81         LD A, (StartupComplete)
 410+ 708C B7               OR A
 411+ 708D C8               RET Z                                ; aún en Inicio: dejar DI
 412+ 708E FB               EI
 413+ 708F C9               RET
