  63+ 8DCD                  ; --- Ejecutar BFS (usa temp stack para CALLs internos) ---
  64+ 8DCD CD E9 8D         CALL MaiFlowBfs
  65+ 8DD0
  66+ 8DD0                  ; --- Cerrar ventana: repaginar bank 0 ---
  67+ 8DD0 3A 8A 8D         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
  68+ 8DD3 E6 F8            AND $F8
  69+ 8DD5 32 8A 8D         LD (CurrentPaging), A
