1341+ 940F E5               PUSH HL
1342+ 9410 F3               DI
1343+ 9411 3A 8A 8D         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
1344+ 9414 E6 F8            AND $F8
1345+ 9416 F6 06            OR 6
1346+ 9418 32 8A 8D         LD (CurrentPaging), A
1347+ 941B 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
1348+ 941E ED 79            OUT (C), A
1349+ 9420 E1               POP HL
1350+ 9421 7E               LD A, (HL)                              ; FlowField byte
1351+ 9422 F5               PUSH AF
1352+ 9423 3A 8A 8D         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
1353+ 9426 E6 F8            AND $F8
1354+ 9428 32 8A 8D         LD (CurrentPaging), A
1355+ 942B 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
1356+ 942E ED 79            OUT (C), A
1357+ 9430 3A A2 81         LD A, (StartupComplete)
1358+ 9433 B7               OR A
1359+ 9434 28 01            JR Z, .cpzaNoEI
1360+ 9436 FB               EI
1361+ 9437              .cpzaNoEI:
1362+ 9437 F1               POP AF
1363+ 9438 3C               INC A                                   ; $FF -> 0 (Z = unreachable), else NZ (reachable)
1364+ 9439 C9               RET
