1394+ 944B 0F               RRCA
1395+ 944C 0F               RRCA
1396+ 944D E6 1F            AND $1F
1397+ 944F 32 ED 94         LD (.fafPy), A
1398+ 9452 AF               XOR A
1399+ 9453 32 E8 94         LD (.fafBestM), A
