 752+ A275              .peShakeActive:
 753+ A275                  ; Pick random direccion cardinal ±1px (4 valores via R & 3)
 754+ A275 ED 5F            LD A, R
 755+ A277 E6 03            AND 3
 756+ A279 28 0C            JR Z, .peShakeUp
 757+ A27B 3D               DEC A
 758+ A27C 28 0F            JR Z, .peShakeDown
