4351+ B711 DD 77 08         LD (IX+ENT_ANIMBASE), A
4352+ B714 DD 77 00         LD (IX+ENT_SPRITEID), A
4353+ B717 DD 36 09 04      LD (IX+ENT_ANIMTIMER), ENEMY_ANIM_DELAY
