5350+ BC78 47               LD B, A
5351+ BC79 3A FA 82         LD A, (CorpseY)
5352+ BC7C B8               CP B
5353+ BC7D DD 7E 04         LD A, (IX+ENT_POSY)
5354+ BC80 30 04            JR NC, .tbyNeg
5355+ BC82 C6 10            ADD A, 16
5356+ BC84 18 02            JR .tbyApply
5357+ BC86              .tbyNeg:
5358+ BC86 D6 10            SUB 16
