5366+ BC96 20 07            JR NZ, .tbyFail
5367+ BC98 CD A9 BC         CALL CheckMonsterOverlap
5368+ BC9B 20 02            JR NZ, .tbyFail
5369+ BC9D AF               XOR A
5370+ BC9E C9               RET
5371+ BC9F              .tbyFail:
5372+ BC9F 3A A8 BC         LD A, (.tbySavePos)
5373+ BCA2 DD 77 04         LD (IX+ENT_POSY), A
