5715+ BE60 32 B0 BE         LD (MonsterTypeTable), A
5716+ BE63 7A               LD A, D
5717+ BE64 32 B2 BE         LD (MonsterTypeTable + 2), A
5718+ BE67 3A B3 BE         LD A, (MonsterColorTable)
