7105+ C69B DD 36 01 05      LD (IX+ENT_TYPE), TYPE_DEATH
7106+ C69F DD 36 02 01      LD (IX+ENT_STATE), STATE_RUNNING
7107+ C6A3 DD 36 00 64      LD (IX+ENT_SPRITEID), SPRID_DEATH
7108+ C6A7 DD 36 0E 64      LD (IX+ENT_OLDSPRID), SPRID_DEATH
7109+ C6AB DD 36 08 64      LD (IX+ENT_ANIMBASE), SPRID_DEATH
