7218+ C73D                  ; --- AABB X: deathX..deathX+23 vs playerX..playerX+15 ---
7219+ C73D                  ; cond1: deathX + 24 > playerX
7220+ C73D DD 7E 03         LD A, (IX+ENT_POSX)
