7232+ C751 57               LD D, A
7233+ C752 DD 7E 03         LD A, (IX+ENT_POSX)
7234+ C755 BA               CP D
7235+ C756 D0               RET NC                              ; deathX >= playerX+16 → no overlap
7236+ C757
7237+ C757              .cdtY1:
