7241+ C75C 38 06            JR C, .cdtY2
7242+ C75E 57               LD D, A
7243+ C75F 3A A7 81         LD A, (EntityTable + ENT_POSY)
7244+ C762 BA               CP D
7245+ C763 D0               RET NC
