7671+ C9CE 32 BF 82         LD (CurrentObjective), A
7672+ C9D1 32 B6 82         LD (CurrentKey), A
7673+ C9D4 32 BA 82         LD (ChurchEverOpened), A
7674+ C9D7 32 B9 82         LD (ChurchDoorOpen), A
7675+ C9DA 32 BB 82         LD (TimeFrozen), A
7676+ C9DD 32 B8 82         LD (ChurchKeySpawned), A
