7709+ CA40 3E 01            LD A, 1
7710+ CA42 32 F6 82         LD (PlayerRespawnVisible), A
7711+ CA45 3E 00            LD A, BLACK
7712+ CA47 32 8B 8D         LD (CurrentBorderColor), A
7713+ CA4A D3 FE            OUT (254), A
