 182+ CE3A C6 14            ADD A, 20
 183+ CE3C 4F               LD C, A
 184+ CE3D CD 08 D6         CALL IsPointBlocked
 185+ CE40 C2 6A CE         JP NZ, .noEast
 186+ CE43 3A 10 83         LD A, (CurrentScreenX)
 187+ CE46 3C               INC A
