1228+ D3F1                  ; eraseRect = [eX..eX+3] × [eY..eY+3].
1229+ D3F1                  ; Overlap: pX <= eX+3 AND pXEnd >= eX AND pY <= eY+3 AND pYEnd >= eY.
1230+ D3F1                  ; eX+3 < pX -> no overlap (X)
