1239+ D3FF BE               CP (HL)
1240+ D400 38 25            JR C, .roaAabbNext1
1241+ D402 23               INC HL                              ; pXEnd
1242+ D403                  ; pXEnd < eX -> no overlap
1243+ D403 7E               LD A, (HL)
