2480+ D9AF 4F               LD C, A
2481+ D9B0 C6 10            ADD A, 16
2482+ D9B2 57               LD D, A
2483+ D9B3 3A 98 DA         LD A, (.cbtSpY)
2484+ D9B6 D6 04            SUB 4
2485+ D9B8 30 01            JR NC, .cbtNoUnderflowT
2486+ D9BA AF               XOR A
2487+ D9BB              .cbtNoUnderflowT:
2488+ D9BB BA               CP D
2489+ D9BC D2 81 DA         JP NC, .cbtPopNext
2490+ D9BF 3A 9A DA         LD A, (.cbtSpH)
2491+ D9C2 47               LD B, A
