 181+ E4F5 CD 8F EC         CALL SetClockToPhaseHour
 182+ E4F8 C9               RET
 183+ E4F9
 184+ E4F9              .notPressed:
 185+ E4F9 AF               XOR A
 186+ E4FA 32 4A E4         LD (DebugKeyDebounce), A
