 228+ ECC9 38 05            JR C, .minOk
 229+ ECCB D6 05            SUB 5
 230+ ECCD 04               INC B
 231+ ECCE 18 F7            JR .divMin
 232+ ECD0              .minOk:
 233+ ECD0 78               LD A, B
 234+ ECD1 21 C3 EA         LD HL, MinHandPtrs
 235+ ECD4 CD C1 EE         CALL DrawHandLine
