 352+ ED82                  ; --- Atributos del sprite (2 filas × 6 cols) ---
 353+ ED82                  ; Layout: [dec0][dec1][sfera_L][sfera_R][dec2][dec3]
 354+ ED82                  ; Decoracion (cols 0,1,4,5): remap paper via ApplyDayCycleRemap
 355+ ED82                  ; Esfera (cols 2,3): sin remap (gestionada por DrawClockFaceOnly)
