 206+ FB12              ; --- SFX_Thunder: trueno al romper la estatua (fase SHAKE de iglesia) ---
 207+ FB12              ; Crack seco inicial + rumble grave. Suena mientras el borde esta en blanco.
 208+ FB12              ; pitch=0 en noise = delay random R&31|1 (textura densa). Pitch mayor = mas lento.
 209+ FB12              SFX_Thunder:
 210+ FB12 3C 00 00 01      DEFB  60,  0, 0, 1    ; crack: noise denso random, burst (~120ms est.)
 211+ FB16 50 08 00 01      DEFB  80,  8, 0, 1    ; rumble: noise a pitch 8 (~160ms est.)
 212+ FB1A 32 14 00 01      DEFB  50, 20, 0, 1    ; tail: noise a pitch 20, mas espaciado (~100ms est.)
 213+ FB1E 00               DEFB   0               ; ~380ms total
