 215+ FB1F
 216+ FB1F              ; --- SFX_CountdownTick: bip ~700ms para "3" y "2" del countdown ---
 217+ FB1F              ; Pitch 102 = ~1047 Hz. Calibrado para octava precisa con pitch 50 (ratio 1.992).
 218+ FB1F              ; (PlaySFX tiene ~78T de overhead por ciclo ademas de 32*pitch -> ratio puro
 219+ FB1F              ; 100/50 quedaria desafinado ~30 cents. Compensado a 102 da ~7 cents.)
 220+ FB1F              SFX_CountdownTick:
 221+ FB1F FA 66 00 00      DEFB 250, 102, 0, 0         ; ~239ms
 222+ FB23 FA 66 00 00      DEFB 250, 102, 0, 0         ; ~478ms
 223+ FB27 E6 66 00 00      DEFB 230, 102, 0, 0         ; ~219ms (total ~718ms)
 224+ FB2B 00               DEFB 0
 225+ FB2C
 226+ FB2C              ; --- SFX_CountdownGo: octava arriba del Tick, ~1s ---
 227+ FB2C              ; Pitch 50 = ~2086 Hz. Ratio period(102)/period(50) = 3342/1678 = 1.992.
 228+ FB2C              SFX_CountdownGo:
 229+ FB2C FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0          ; ~120ms cada step
 230+ FB30 FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 231+ FB34 FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 232+ FB38 FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 233+ FB3C FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 234+ FB40 FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 235+ FB44 FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 236+ FB48 FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 237+ FB4C 5A 32 00 00      DEFB 90, 50, 0, 0           ; total ~1003ms
 238+ FB50 00               DEFB 0
