 451+ E5AF 23               INC HL
 452+ E5B0 4E               LD C, (HL)                           ; coord
 453+ E5B1 23               INC HL
 454+ E5B2 57               LD D, A                              ; D = side_comp
 455+ E5B3 E6 03            AND $03                              ; side
 456+ E5B5 5F               LD E, A
