1336+ F15B FE 06            CP ROLLED_ROULETTE
1336+ F15D 28 3A          JR Z, .crsApplyRouletteHit
1337+ F15F FE 01            CP ROLLED_LIFE
1337+ F161 CA 20 EB       JP Z, GiveLifeBody
1338+ F164 FE 02            CP ROLLED_HEALTH
1338+ F166 CA 2B EB       JP Z, GiveHealthBody
1339+ F169 FE 03            CP ROLLED_STAMINA
1339+ F16B CA 3C EB       JP Z, GiveStaminaBody
